        "## 4. Results (vs baseline)\n",
        "\n",
        "### Honest headline result\n",
        "\n",
        "W05/W06 established the capstone result:\n",
        "\n",
        "- **Logistic Regression: 0.86 Precision@50**\n",
        "- **Week-4 rule baseline: 0.34 Precision@50**\n",
        "- **Random Forest: 0.52 Precision@50**\n",
        "- **Test base rate: 0.511**\n",
        "- **Naive random row-level split: 0.92 Precision@50, but 31 clients leaked across train/test**\n",
