        "id": "740ee461"
      },
      "source": [
        "## 5. Limitations\n",
        "\n",
        "1. **The final label is a current-window proxy.** `trend_direction` comes from the snapshot's own trend calculation. It is not proof of a future decline. W03 showed how the proper future-window design should work.\n",
        "2. **Cross-sectional observational data cannot establish causality.** A high score does not mean refreshing the page will increase traffic.\n",
        "3. **One anonymized catalog and one holdout split.** Precision@50 = 0.86 describes this dataset under this validation design.\n",
        "4. **Unranked pages are a model blind spot.** `avg_position == 0` receives very low model probabilities even when a page may have declined. These pages need a separate technical/indexing lane.\n",
        "5. **Thin archetypes need caution.** W07 excludes archetypes with fewer than 200 rows from automatic archetype mappings; the `keyword article / navigational` group was especially thin.\n",
        "6. **Confidence is not certainty.** Borderline probabilities and low-confidence rows should be treated as review candidates, not automatic actions.\n",
        "7. **External events are not represented.** Competitor changes, search-system changes, demand shifts, and other off-page causes are not directly observed in this feature set.\n",
        "8. **A monthly monitoring process is still required.** Re-score alone is not enough if the label behavior, catalog mix, or client population changes.\n"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "id": "9edef08c",
      "metadata": {
        "id": "9edef08c"
      },
      "source": [
        "## 6. Ranked recommendations\n",
        "\n",
        "### Action logic from W07\n",
        "\n",
        "The final queue is intentionally human-facing:\n",
        "\n",
        "| Action | Meaning |\n",
        "|---|---|\n",
        "| `monitor` | Leave alone and keep watching |\n",
        "| `refresh` | Update facts, links, structure, or content |\n",
        "| `refresh_and_review_ctr` | Refresh and inspect title/meta for a CTR gap |\n",
        "| `technical_check_unranked` | Investigate visibility/indexing rather than content quality |\n",
        "\n",
        "**No automatic CMS edits. No automatic publishing/unpublishing. No client-facing decline claims. No batch technical fixes.**\n"
      ]
    },
