        "### Monitoring / retrain triggers\n",
        "\n",
        "The W07 monitoring baseline is intentionally simple:\n",
        "\n",
        "- investigate if held-out Precision@50 falls below roughly **1.5× the baseline** (about **0.51** using the current 0.34 baseline);\n",
        "- investigate a large shift in declining-label base rate;\n",
        "- investigate a sharp increase in unranked-page share;\n",
        "- investigate major content-type/archetype mix changes;\n",
        "- investigate suspicious changes in the no-go/human-review share.\n",
        "\n",
        "**Retrain rather than merely re-score** when the performance trigger fires repeatedly or the data population genuinely changes.\n"
      ]
    },
